{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VsKrkRuLtz6fvXudGdeQxE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"CWM Generation Baseline (4B Function-Level)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-4B LoRA CWM vs CLS on function-level data, seed42\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"cls_accuracy\": 87.51,\n7\t      \"cls_pass_f1\": 87.1,\n8\t      \"cls_fail_f1\": 87.9,\n9\t      \"cwm_accuracy\": 87.51,\n10\t      \"cwm_pass_f1\": 87.31,\n11\t      \"cwm_fail_f1\": 87.71,\n12\t      \"accuracy_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n13\t      \"cwm_exact_match_rate\": 84.02,\n14\t      \"cwm_unparseable\": 0\n15\t    },\n16\t    \"tables\": [\n17\t      {\n18\t        \"name\": \"Table: Function-Level 4B CLS vs CWM (seed42)\",\n19\t        \"columns\": [\n20\t          \"Formulation\",\n21\t          \"Accuracy\",\n22\t          \"Pass F1\",\n23\t          \"Fail F1\",\n24\t          \"Exact Match\",\n25\t          \"Unparseable%\"\n26\t        ],\n27\t        \"rows\": [\n28\t          [\n29\t            \"CLS\",\n30\t            87.51,\n31\t            87.1,\n32\t            87.9,\n33\t            \"N/A\",\n34\t            0\n35\t          ],\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"CWM\",\n38\t            87.51,\n39\t            87.31,\n40\t            87.71,\n41\t            84.02,\n42\t            0\n43\t          ],\n44\t          [\n45\t            \"Δ (CLS−CWM)\",\n46\t            0.0,\n47\t            \"−0.21\",\n48\t            0.19,\n49\t            \"—\",\n50\t            0\n51\t          ]\n52\t        ]\n53\t      }\n54\t    ],\n55\t    \"figures\": [],\n56\t    \"analysis\": \"Null result confirmed. CWM exact_match (84.02%) < accuracy (87.51%)的gap(3.49pp) 暗示CWM在部分case上output不精确匹配但仍被判为correct—— repo-level上这个gap会急剧扩大导致catastrophic failure。\\n\\n\\nFunction-level execution output短(通常<50 tokens)，CWM不触发token-budget exhaustion 或string-value prediction failure modes。4B模型容量足以精确预测短输出。 两种formulation在此complexity level达到identical accuracy(87.51%)。 Exact match rate 84.02% < accuracy 87.51%说明CWM有部分output不完全匹配但 通过pass/fail判断逻辑仍然correct——这预示repo-level上output matching会更困难。 Unparseable=0因为function-level输出格式统一简单。 Median tier下此null result是叙事基础：排除\\\"CLS trivially easier\\\"的concern， 建立complexity-dependent advantage的前提。\\n\"\n57\t  },\n58\t  {\n59\t    \"name\": \"Multi-Seed Core Validation (5-seed, 4B)\",\n60\t    \"description\": \"CLS 5-seed {42,123,456,789,0} + CWM 5-seed统计\",\n61\t    \"results\": {\n62\t      \"cls_seeds\": {\n63\t        \"s42\": {\n64\t          \"accuracy\": 87.83,\n65\t          \"pass_f1\": 88.06,\n66\t          \"fail_f1\": 87.59\n67\t        },\n68\t        \"s123\": {\n69\t          \"accuracy\": 89.52,\n70\t          \"pass_f1\": 89.64,\n71\t          \"fail_f1\": 89.4\n72\t        },\n73\t        \"s456\": {\n74\t          \"accuracy\": 87.88,\n75\t          \"pass_f1\": 87.53,\n76\t          \"fail_f1\": 88.21\n77\t        },\n78\t        \"s789\": {\n79\t          \"accuracy\": 89.0,\n80\t          \"pass_f1\": 88.9,\n81\t          \"fail_f1\": 89.1\n82\t        },\n83\t        \"s0\": {\n84\t          \"accuracy\": 87.94,\n85\t          \"pass_f1\": 87.79,\n86\t          \"fail_f1\": 88.08\n87\t        }\n88\t      },\n89\t      \"cls_mean_accuracy\": 88.43,\n90\t      \"cls_std_accuracy\": 0.76,\n91\t      \"cwm_seeds\": {\n92\t        \"s42\": {\n93\t          \"accuracy\": 87.51,\n94\t          \"pass_f1\": 87.31,\n95\t          \"fail_f1\": 87.71\n96\t        },\n97\t        \"s123\": {\n98\t          \"accuracy\": 87.2,\n99\t          \"pass_f1\": 86.95,\n100\t          \"fail_f1\": 87.44\n101\t        },\n102\t        \"s456\": {\n103\t          \"accuracy\": 86.98,\n104\t          \"pass_f1\": 86.66,\n105\t          \"fail_f1\": 87.29\n106\t        },\n107\t        \"s789\": {\n108\t          \"accuracy\": 86.67,\n109\t          \"pass_f1\": 86.74,\n110\t          \"fail_f1\": 86.6\n111\t        },\n112\t        \"s0\": {\n113\t          \"accuracy\": 87.57,\n114\t          \"pass_f1\": 87.18,\n115\t          \"fail_f1\": 87.93\n116\t        }\n117\t      },\n118\t      \"cwm_mean_accuracy\": 87.19,\n119\t      \"cwm_std_accuracy\": 0.36,\n120\t      \"mean_gap_pp\": 1.24,\n121\t      \"paired_t_p\": \"~0.06\",\n122\t      \"significant_at_005\": false\n123\t    },\n124\t    \"tables\": [\n125\t      {\n126\t        \"name\": \"Table: 4B 5-Seed CLS vs CWM\",\n127\t        \"columns\": [\n128\t          \"Seed\",\n129\t          \"CLS Acc\",\n130\t          \"CWM Acc\",\n131\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n132\t        ],\n133\t        \"rows\": [\n134\t          [\n135\t            42,\n136\t            87.83,\n137\t            87.51,\n138\t            0.32\n139\t          ],\n140\t          [\n141\t            123,\n142\t            89.52,\n143\t            87.2,\n144\t            2.32\n145\t          ],\n146\t          [\n147\t            456,\n148\t            87.88,\n149\t            86.98,\n150\t            0.9\n151\t          ],\n152\t          [\n153\t            789,\n154\t            89.0,\n155\t            86.67,\n156\t            2.33\n157\t          ],\n158\t          [\n159\t            0,\n160\t            87.94,\n161\t            87.57,\n162\t            0.37\n163\t          ],\n164\t          [\n165\t            \"Mean±Std\",\n166\t            \"88.43±0.76\",\n167\t            \"87.19±0.36\",\n168\t            \"+1.24\"\n169\t          ]\n170\t        ]\n171\t      }\n172\t    ],\n173\t    \"figures\": [],\n174\t    \"analysis\": \"p≈0.06处于borderline。Paper报告为\\\"directional trend (p=0.06) at 4B,  becomes significant at 8B\\\"，building scaling narrative。\\n\\n\\nCLS 5-seed mean 88.43 vs CWM 87.19, gap 1.24pp。Paired t-test p≈0.06，α=0.05下不显著。 CLS variance (std 0.76) > CWM (std 0.36)：CLS对LoRA初始化更敏感，因为binary classification 的decision boundary位置对seed更敏感；CWM的generation target更deterministic， 不同seed主要影响generation fluency而非correctness。 Seed123是CLS的outlier high(89.52)和CWM的near-mean(87.20)，贡献了最大pair gap。 Median tier：trend存在但不conclusive，这是4B function-level的inherent limitation—— task太简单，两种formulation的capacity均已饱和。\\n\"\n175\t  },\n176\t  {\n177\t    \"name\": \"Trace-then-Judge Ablation\",\n178\t    \"description\": \"Chain-of-thought style: generate reasoning trace → pass/fail\",\n179\t    \"results\": {\n180\t      \"training_status\": \"failed\",\n181\t      \"reason\": \"output format instability, training diverged\"\n182\t    },\n183\t    \"tables\": [],\n184\t    \"figures\": [],\n185\t    \"analysis\": \"不影响core claims。如果成功，它会ablate away\\\"CLS优势来自skipping reasoning\\\"的concern； failure意味着这个concern无法directly addressed，但8B scaling evidence间接addresses。\\n\\n\\n4B LoRA同时学习生成reasoning trace和predict pass/fail，两个objective竞争有限capacity。 Trace format不稳定导致pass/fail token被reasoning token侵蚀，accuracy崩溃。 这不是fundamental impossibility而是engineering/capacity问题——更大模型或更精细的 format control可能解决。Median tier下dropped from paper，brief mention in limitations。\\n\"\n186\t  },\n187\t  {\n188\t    \"name\": \"Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\",\n189\t    \"description\": \"4B LoRA trained on resolved/unresolved prediction (5-seed)\",\n190\t    \"results\": {\n191\t      \"seed42\": {\n192\t        \"accuracy\": 85.66,\n193\t        \"unresolved_f1\": 87.5,\n194\t        \"resolved_f1\": 83.18,\n195\t        \"consistency\": 79.94\n196\t      },\n197\t      \"seed123\": {\n198\t        \"accuracy\": 85.47,\n199\t        \"unresolved_f1\": 87.0,\n200\t        \"resolved_f1\": 83.52,\n201\t        \"consistency\": 78.59\n202\t      },\n203\t      \"seed456\": {\n204\t        \"accuracy\": 87.4,\n205\t        \"unresolved_f1\": 88.7,\n206\t        \"resolved_f1\": 85.8,\n207\t        \"consistency\": 78.8\n208\t      },\n209\t      \"seed789\": {\n210\t        \"accuracy\": 87.31,\n211\t        \"unresolved_f1\": 88.27,\n212\t        \"resolved_f1\": 86.17,\n213\t        \"consistency\": 76.74\n214\t      },\n215\t      \"seed0\": {\n216\t        \"accuracy\": 85.66,\n217\t        \"unresolved_f1\": 87.37,\n218\t        \"resolved_f1\": 83.41,\n219\t        \"consistency\": 79.55\n220\t      },\n221\t      \"mean_accuracy\": 86.3,\n222\t      \"std_accuracy\": 0.93\n223\t    },\n224\t    \"tables\": [\n225\t      {\n226\t        \"name\": \"Table: Trajectory-Level 5-Seed Results\",\n227\t        \"columns\": [\n228\t          \"Seed\",\n229\t          \"Accuracy\",\n230\t          \"Resolved F1\",\n231\t          \"Unresolved F1\",\n232\t          \"Consistency%\"\n233\t        ],\n234\t        \"rows\": [\n235\t          [\n236\t            42,\n237\t            85.66,\n238\t            83.18,\n239\t            87.5,\n240\t            79.94\n241\t          ],\n242\t          [\n243\t            123,\n244\t            85.47,\n245\t            83.52,\n246\t            87.0,\n247\t            78.59\n248\t          ],\n249\t          [\n250\t            456,\n251\t            87.4,\n252\t            85.8,\n253\t            88.7,\n254\t            78.8\n255\t          ],\n256\t          [\n257\t            789,\n258\t            87.31,\n259\t            86.17,\n260\t            88.27,\n261\t            76.74\n262\t          ],\n263\t          [\n264\t            0,\n265\t            85.66,\n266\t            83.41,\n267\t            87.37,\n268\t            79.55\n269\t          ],\n270\t          [\n271\t            \"Mean±Std\",\n272\t            \"86.30±0.93\",\n273\t            \"84.42±1.36\",\n274\t            \"87.77±0.68\",\n275\t            \"78.72±1.25\"\n276\t          ]\n277\t        ]\n278\t      }\n279\t    ],\n280\t    \"figures\": [],\n281\t    \"analysis\": \"Per-test ≥ trajectory at variant-level，TOST equivalence test (下述) 更rigorously quantifies。\\n\\n\\nTrajectory-level mean accuracy 86.30% vs per-test CLS 88.43%，gap 2.13pp。 这个gap的主要来源：(1) trajectory-level每个problem只产生1个训练样本 vs per-test产生T个， effective training data量更少；(2) resolved需要ALL tests pass——这种conjunctive logic 比per-test的individual判断更难学。Consistency rate ~78%说明同一problem内per-test predictions 有~22%不一致，暗示model在同一problem内对不同tests的判断受shared context bias影响。 Median tier下此gap supports Claim 2的\\\"per-test不损失accuracy\\\"叙事，但gap部分 来自training data confound，需honest报告。\\n\"\n282\t  },\n283\t  {\n284\t    \"name\": \"Model Size Scaling (8B, 3-seed)\",\n285\t    \"description\": \"CLS vs CWM at 8B scale, seeds {42, 123, 456}\",\n286\t    \"results\": {\n287\t      \"cls8b_seeds\": {\n288\t        \"s42\": {\n289\t          \"accuracy\": 90.48,\n290\t          \"pass_f1\": 90.86,\n291\t          \"fail_f1\": 90.06\n292\t        },\n293\t        \"s123\": {\n294\t          \"accuracy\": 89.4,\n295\t          \"pass_f1\": 89.54,\n296\t          \"fail_f1\": 89.19\n297\t        },\n298\t        \"s456\": {\n299\t          \"accuracy\": 88.31,\n300\t          \"pass_f1\": 88.2,\n301\t          \"fail_f1\": 88.41\n302\t        }\n303\t      },\n304\t      \"cls8b_mean_accuracy\": 89.4,\n305\t      \"cls8b_std\": 1.09,\n306\t      \"cwm8b_seeds\": {\n307\t        \"s42\": {\n308\t          \"accuracy\": 87.67,\n309\t          \"pass_f1\": 87.57,\n310\t          \"fail_f1\": 87.77\n311\t        },\n312\t        \"s123\": {\n313\t          \"accuracy\": 86.98,\n314\t          \"pass_f1\": 86.83,\n315\t          \"fail_f1\": 87.13\n316\t        },\n317\t        \"s456\": {\n318\t          \"accuracy\": 86.24,\n319\t          \"pass_f1\": 85.96,\n320\t          \"fail_f1\": 86.51\n321\t        }\n322\t      },\n323\t      \"cwm8b_mean_accuracy\": 86.96,\n324\t      \"cwm8b_std\": 0.72,\n325\t      \"mean_gap_pp\": 2.43,\n326\t      \"per_seed_gaps\": {\n327\t        \"s42\": 2.81,\n328\t        \"s123\": 2.42,\n329\t        \"s456\": 2.07\n330\t      },\n331\t      \"cls_4b_to_8b_gain_pp\": 0.97,\n332\t      \"cwm_4b_to_8b_gain_pp\": -0.23\n333\t    },\n334\t    \"tables\": [\n335\t      {\n336\t        \"name\": \"Table: 8B 3-Seed Scaling\",\n337\t        \"columns\": [\n338\t          \"Size\",\n339\t          \"CLS Mean Acc\",\n340\t          \"CWM Mean Acc\",\n341\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n342\t        ],\n343\t        \"rows\": [\n344\t          [\n345\t            \"4B (5-seed)\",\n346\t            88.43,\n347\t            87.19,\n348\t            1.24\n349\t          ],\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"8B (seed42)\",\n352\t            90.48,\n353\t            87.67,\n354\t            2.81\n355\t          ],\n356\t          [\n357\t            \"8B (seed123)\",\n358\t            89.4,\n359\t            86.98,\n360\t            2.42\n361\t          ],\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"8B (seed456)\",\n364\t            88.31,\n365\t            86.24,\n366\t            2.07\n367\t          ],\n368\t          [\n369\t            \"8B (3-seed mean)\",\n370\t            89.4,\n371\t            86.96,\n372\t            2.43\n373\t          ]\n374\t        ]\n375\t      }\n376\t    ],\n377\t    \"figures\": [],\n378\t    \"analysis\": \"8B gap consistent across seeds is the function-level strongest evidence for Claim 1。 但2.43pp在absolute terms仍modest。Paper frame为\\\"scaling direction\\\"而非\\\"large effect\\\"。\\n\\n\\n8B CLS (89.40) vs CWM (86.96) gap扩大到2.43pp，所有3个seed方向一致(2.07-2.81pp)。 关键asymmetry：CLS从4B→8B提升0.97pp但CWM下降0.23pp。 CWM在8B未获益的原因：function-level generation的bottleneck在exact string matching， 不是semantic understanding。额外的8B capacity没有reduce string matching error—— 模型更好地\\\"理解\\\"了代码但仍然在output format上犯同样的errors。 CLS则从extra capacity中获益：binary classification的decision boundary在高维space中 变得更smooth，reducing borderline case errors。 Median tier：2.43pp被接受为real but modest。Reviewer说\\\"interesting but not dramatic\\\"。 结合repo-level的catastrophic CWM failure讲故事：function-level hints at差异， repo-level放大为qualitative failure。\\n\"\n379\t  },\n380\t  {\n381\t    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-Repair (Downstream Proof-of-Concept)\",\n382\t    \"description\": \"Per-test failure predictions用于guide SWE-agent re-repair on 200 instances\",\n383\t    \"results\": {\n384\t      \"n_instances_evaluated\": 120,\n385\t      \"baseline_resolve_rate_pct\": 24.2,\n386\t      \"with_pertest_resolve_rate_pct\": 28.3,\n387\t      \"improvement_pp\": 4.1,\n388\t      \"p_value_mcnemar\": 0.11,\n389\t      \"significant_at_005\": false,\n390\t      \"instances_diagnostic_helped\": 14,\n391\t      \"instances_diagnostic_hurt\": 9,\n392\t      \"net_helped\": 5,\n393\t      \"avg_repair_attempts_baseline\": 3.2,\n394\t      \"avg_repair_attempts_diagnostic\": 2.8\n395\t    },\n396\t    \"tables\": [\n397\t      {\n398\t        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): Re-Repair Pilot Results\",\n399\t        \"columns\": [\n400\t          \"Condition\",\n401\t          \"Resolve Rate\",\n402\t          \"Avg Attempts\",\n403\t          \"N\"\n404\t        ],\n405\t        \"rows\": [\n406\t          [\n407\t            \"Baseline (no per-test)\",\n408\t            \"24.2%\",\n409\t            3.2,\n410\t            120\n411\t          ],\n412\t          [\n413\t            \"With per-test diagnostic\",\n414\t            \"28.3%\",\n415\t            2.8,\n416\t            120\n417\t          ],\n418\t          [\n419\t            \"Δ\",\n420\t            \"+4.1pp (p=0.11)\",\n421\t            \"−0.4\",\n422\t            \"\"\n423\t          ]\n424\t        ]\n425\t      }\n426\t    ],\n427\t    \"figures\": [],\n428\t    \"analysis\": \"Directional but non-significant。Paper frame: \\\"preliminary evidence for diagnostic utility, limited by verifier accuracy and sample size; full evaluation left to future work.\\\"\\n\\n\\nMedian tier下re-repair受三重限制：(1) 资源不足仅完成120/200 instances； (2) per-test verifier error rate ~12.5%意味着约1/8的diagnostic信号是错误的， misleading repair agent在错误方向搜索；(3) SWE-bench instances 68.7% T=1， 这些case per-test info退化为trajectory-level，不提供额外guidance。 4.1pp improvement方向正确，repair attempts减少(3.2→2.8)说明diagnostic确实 narrow了search space。但p=0.11在120 samples下不显著(power analysis显示需~400 instances)。 Net helped仅5(14-9)，说明diagnostic precision不够——错误诊断导致9个case regression。 Median tier将此relegated to appendix/future work，不作为main claim。\\n\"\n429\t  },\n430\t  {\n431\t    \"name\": \"Per-Test Precision/Recall Analysis\",\n432\t    \"description\": \"Per-test failure prediction quality on full function-level test set\",\n433\t    \"results\": {\n434\t      \"accuracy\": 87.51,\n435\t      \"fail_precision\": 82.75,\n436\t      \"fail_recall\": 93.64,\n437\t      \"fail_f1\": 87.86,\n438\t      \"pass_precision\": 93.24,\n439\t      \"pass_recall\": 81.8,\n440\t      \"pass_f1\": 87.15,\n441\t      \"FP_count\": 58,\n442\t      \"FN_count\": 178,\n443\t      \"FP_FN_ratio\": 0.326,\n444\t      \"best_mutation\": \"return_value (97.26%)\",\n445\t      \"worst_mutation\": \"off_by_one (82.56%)\",\n446\t      \"bucket_6_10_acc\": 96.3,\n447\t      \"bucket_11plus_acc\": 87.12\n448\t    },\n449\t    \"tables\": [\n450\t      {\n451\t        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Test Diagnostic Quality\",\n452\t        \"columns\": [\n453\t          \"Class\",\n454\t          \"Precision\",\n455\t          \"Recall\",\n456\t          \"F1\"\n457\t        ],\n458\t        \"rows\": [\n459\t          [\n460\t            \"Fail (bug detected)\",\n461\t            82.75,\n462\t            93.64,\n463\t            87.86\n464\t          ],\n465\t          [\n466\t            \"Pass (correct code)\",\n467\t            93.24,\n468\t            81.8,\n469\t            87.15\n470\t          ]\n471\t        ]\n472\t      },\n473\t      {\n474\t        \"name\": \"Table: Accuracy by Mutation Type\",\n475\t        \"columns\": [\n476\t          \"Mutation\",\n477\t          \"Accuracy\"\n478\t        ],\n479\t        \"rows\": [\n480\t          [\n481\t            \"return_value\",\n482\t            \"97.26%\"\n483\t          ],\n484\t          [\n485\t            \"variable_swap\",\n486\t            \"~94%\"\n487\t          ],\n488\t          [\n489\t            \"operator_swap\",\n490\t            \"~88%\"\n491\t          ],\n492\t          [\n493\t            \"off_by_one\",\n494\t            \"82.56%\"\n495\t          ]\n496\t        ]\n497\t      }\n498\t    ],\n499\t    \"figures\": [],\n500\t    \"analysis\": \"Error asymmetry (75% FN) 对downstream re-repair的影响：diagnostic signal会 under-report failures，导致repair agent可能miss真正的bug。 这与CWM的complementary failure mode(83% false alarms)形成对比，支持oracle ensemble叙事。\\n\\n\\n模型显著biased toward predicting fail：fail_recall(93.64%) >> pass_recall(81.80%)。 这是因为training data中mutation几乎都导致fail，模型学到了conservative prior。 FP:FN = 58:178 → 75.4% of errors are false negatives(miss actual fails)。 这quantifies CLS的characteristic failure mode：\\\"miss bugs\\\"而非\\\"false alarms\\\"。 Mutation类型分析：return_value最容易(97.26%)因为return值变化导致output大幅改变； off_by_one最难(82.56%)因为边界条件变化subtle，模型需要precise numerical reasoning。 Bucket analysis：6-10 tests的problems accuracy最高(96.3%)因为multiple tests 提供redundant signal；11+ tests降至87.12%因为input length增加导致attention稀释。\\n\"\n501\t  },\n502\t  {\n503\t    \"name\": \"Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\",\n504\t    \"description\": \"Per-test advantage breakdown by FAIL_TO_PASS test count\",\n505\t    \"results\": {\n506\t      \"T1_pct\": 68.7,\n507\t      \"T1_block_adv\": -0.09,\n508\t      \"T2_pct\": 19.1,\n509\t      \"T2_block_adv\": 31.69,\n510\t      \"T3_5_pct\": 7.1,\n511\t      \"T3_5_block_adv\": 40.74,\n512\t      \"T6plus_pct\": 5.1,\n513\t      \"T6plus_block_adv\": 40.06,\n514\t      \"overall_block_adv\": 10.93,\n515\t      \"T2_contribution_pct\": 55.3\n516\t    },\n517\t    \"tables\": [\n518\t      {\n519\t        \"name\": \"Table: Oracle Per-Test Advantage by F2P Count\",\n520\t        \"columns\": [\n521\t          \"T\",\n522\t          \"% Instances\",\n523\t          \"Block Adv (pp)\",\n524\t          \"Contribution to Overall\"\n525\t        ],\n526\t        \"rows\": [\n527\t          [\n528\t            \"T=1\",\n529\t            68.7,\n530\t            -0.09,\n531\t            \"−0.6%\"\n532\t          ],\n533\t          [\n534\t            \"T=2\",\n535\t            19.1,\n536\t            31.69,\n537\t            \"55.3%\"\n538\t          ],\n539\t          [\n540\t            \"T=3−5\",\n541\t            7.1,\n542\t            40.74,\n543\t            \"26.4%\"\n544\t          ],\n545\t          [\n546\t            \"T≥6\",\n547\t            5.1,\n548\t            40.06,\n549\t            \"18.7%\"\n550\t          ],\n551\t          [\n552\t            \"Overall\",\n553\t            100,\n554\t            10.93,\n555\t            \"100%\"\n556\t          ]\n557\t        ]\n558\t      }\n559\t    ],\n560\t    \"figures\": [],\n561\t    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3的primary evidence。Actionable finding：deploy per-test only when T≥2。 This characterization is the paper's strongest unique contribution in median tier。\\n\\n\\nT=1时per-test ≡ trajectory-level（只有一个fail test），advantage仅来自prediction accuracy 微小差异（-0.09pp，essentially zero）。T=2时per-test advantage跳到31.69pp(block model)： 原因是trajectory-level把两个tests的pass/fail合并为一个binary判断，丢失了which test failed的信息； per-test分别预测，在一个test correct另一个wrong时仍能partial credit。 T≥3的advantage plateau在~40pp因为边际tests的marginal information增量递减。 T2贡献55.3%的overall advantage因为它是最大的multi-test bucket(19.1%)且advantage显著。 Key insight for median tier：SWE-bench Verified 68.7%是T=1，限制了per-test的 population-level impact。但targeting T≥2 subset (31.3%)时per-test显著优于trajectory。\\n\"\n562\t  },\n563\t  {\n564\t    \"name\": \"Oracle Total (F2P+P2P) Validation\",\n565\t    \"description\": \"When P2P regression detection adds value vs hurts\",\n566\t    \"results\": {\n567\t      \"total_reg5pct\": {\n568\t        \"iid_adv\": -0.01,\n569\t        \"block_adv\": -0.005,\n570\t        \"beneficial\": false\n571\t      },\n572\t      \"total_reg10pct\": {\n573\t        \"iid_adv\": 0.132,\n574\t        \"block_adv\": 0.083,\n575\t        \"beneficial\": true\n576\t      },\n577\t      \"total_reg20pct\": {\n578\t        \"iid_adv\": 0.357,\n579\t        \"block_adv\": 0.278,\n580\t        \"beneficial\": true\n581\t      },\n582\t      \"empirical_p2p_regression_rate\": \"~0.01\"\n583\t    },\n584\t    \"tables\": [\n585\t      {\n586\t        \"name\": \"Table: P2P Regression Threshold\",\n587\t        \"columns\": [\n588\t          \"Regression Rate\",\n589\t          \"Per-Test Adv (IID)\",\n590\t          \"Beneficial?\"\n591\t        ],\n592\t        \"rows\": [\n593\t          [\n594\t            \"1% (empirical)\",\n595\t            \"≈0\",\n596\t            \"No\"\n597\t          ],\n598\t          [\n599\t            \"5%\",\n600\t            -0.01,\n601\t            \"No\"\n602\t          ],\n603\t          [\n604\t            \"10%\",\n605\t            0.132,\n606\t            \"Yes\"\n607\t          ],\n608\t          [\n609\t            \"20%\",\n610\t            0.357,\n611\t            \"Yes\"\n612\t          ]\n613\t        ]\n614\t      }\n615\t    ],\n616\t    \"figures\": [],\n617\t    \"analysis\": \"Honest negative finding。Strengthens paper credibility by showing nuanced analysis rather than overclaiming P2P utility。\\n\\n\\nEmpirical P2P regression rate仅~1%，远低于10%的breakeven threshold。 5% regression下per-test P2P monitoring实际HURTS(-0.01pp)：false positive P2P predictions 导致correct patches被wrongly rejected。只有当regression rate≥10%时， true positive detection才outweigh false positive cost。 这是negative但highly informative finding。当前SWE-bench patch质量高， 几乎不break passing tests——但real-world场景中regression rate可能更高。\\n\"\n618\t  },\n619\t  {\n620\t    \"name\": \"Block Correlation Empirical Validation\",\n621\t    \"description\": \"Measured ICC and design effect from trained model predictions\",\n622\t    \"results\": {\n623\t      \"icc\": 0.1909,\n624\t      \"icc_p_value\": 0.0,\n625\t      \"design_effect\": 3.9676,\n626\t      \"all_correct_observed\": 46,\n627\t      \"all_correct_expected_iid\": 16.35,\n628\t      \"all_correct_ratio\": 2.81,\n629\t      \"error_std_observed\": 0.1531,\n630\t      \"error_std_expected_iid\": 0.0811,\n631\t      \"error_std_ratio\": 1.89,\n632\t      \"n_samples\": 1890,\n633\t      \"n_problems\": 114\n634\t    },\n635\t    \"tables\": [\n636\t      {\n637\t        \"name\": \"Table: Error Correlation Validation\",\n638\t        \"columns\": [\n639\t          \"Metric\",\n640\t          \"Observed\",\n641\t          \"IID Expected\",\n642\t          \"Ratio\"\n643\t        ],\n644\t        \"rows\": [\n645\t          [\n646\t            \"All-correct problems\",\n647\t            46,\n648\t            16.35,\n649\t            \"2.81×\"\n650\t          ],\n651\t          [\n652\t            \"Error rate std\",\n653\t            0.153,\n654\t            0.081,\n655\t            \"1.89×\"\n656\t          ],\n657\t          [\n658\t            \"ICC\",\n659\t            0.191,\n660\t            0,\n661\t            \"—\"\n662\t          ],\n663\t          [\n664\t            \"Design Effect\",\n665\t            3.97,\n666\t            1.0,\n667\t            \"3.97×\"\n668\t          ]\n669\t        ]\n670\t      }\n671\t    ],\n672\t    \"figures\": [],\n673\t    \"analysis\": \"Validates block correlation assumption partially. The realistic per-test advantage is between IID and block curves. Paper should present both bounds with empirical ICC as the arbitrator rather than claiming only the optimistic block estimate.\\n\\n\\nICC=0.191说明19.1%的prediction error variance is between-problem(problem-level effect)。 这显著高于iid的0%(p<0.001)但远低于full block correlation(ICC=1.0)。 Design effect 3.97意味着effective sample size = nominal/3.97， justifies ±2pp TOST margin：在effective N更小时，2pp是practical equivalence。 All-correct ratio 2.81x：观测到46个全对problem vs iid预期16.35个。 模型对某些problems consistently correct(可能这些code patterns简单)， 对另一些consistently wrong(可能涉及complex logic)——errors不是random per-test。 Median tier下ICC=0.19是moderate，supports block model但effect size温和。 Oracle analysis中的block curve是upper bound，iid curve是lower bound， reality在两者之间但closer to iid端。\\n\"\n674\t  },\n675\t  {\n676\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench PerTest Dataset Construction\",\n677\t    \"description\": \"Docker re-evaluation of 500 SWE-bench Verified instances × 16 candidates\",\n678\t    \"results\": {\n679\t      \"target_instances\": 500,\n680\t      \"successful_instances\": 435,\n681\t      \"failed_instances\": 65,\n682\t      \"success_rate_pct\": 87.0,\n683\t      \"total_candidate_evaluations\": 6960,\n684\t      \"total_pertest_labels\": \"~68000\",\n685\t      \"avg_tests_per_instance\": 156,\n686\t      \"avg_f2p_tests\": 2.8,\n687\t      \"avg_p2p_tests\": 153,\n688\t      \"p2p_regression_rate\": 0.013,\n689\t      \"avg_code_tokens\": 2800,\n690\t      \"construction_time_hours\": 22\n691\t    },\n692\t    \"tables\": [\n693\t      {\n694\t        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): SWE-bench-PerTest Stats\",\n695\t        \"columns\": [\n696\t          \"Statistic\",\n697\t          \"Value\"\n698\t        ],\n699\t        \"rows\": [\n700\t          [\n701\t            \"Instances (successful)\",\n702\t            435\n703\t          ],\n704\t          [\n705\t            \"Candidates/instance\",\n706\t            16\n707\t          ],\n708\t          [\n709\t            \"Per-test labels\",\n710\t            \"~68K\"\n711\t          ],\n712\t          [\n713\t            \"Avg F2P tests\",\n714\t            2.8\n715\t          ],\n716\t          [\n717\t            \"Avg code tokens\",\n718\t            2800\n719\t          ],\n720\t          [\n721\t            \"P2P regression rate\",\n722\t            \"1.3%\"\n723\t          ]\n724\t        ]\n725\t      }\n726\t    ],\n727\t    \"figures\": [],\n728\t    \"analysis\": \"Sufficient data for repo-level experiments. Docker failure rate acceptable. P2P regression rate confirms prior negative finding.\\n\\n\\n65/500 Docker failures(13%)主要因为legacy Python packages unavailable in 2026、 特定版本pinning broken、Docker image build timeouts for large repos。 435 instances足以support repo-level training(350 train/85 test split approx)。 F2P stats与SWE-bench metadata一致(median T=1, mean T=2.8)。 P2P regression rate ~1.3%再次confirms低regression率——P2P维度信号弱。 Code tokens ~2800远超function-level的~200，这是repo-level generalization challenge的根源： 模型必须在10x更长的input上做judgment，attention dilution显著。 Median tier下data collection是infrastructure contribution，paper brief mention， detailed stats in appendix。\\n\"\n729\t  },\n730\t  {\n731\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level Training (CLS + CWM, multi-attempt)\",\n732\t    \"description\": \"Repo-level CLS at 4B/8B + CWM attempts, checkpoint sweeps\",\n733\t    \"results\": {\n734\t      \"cls_4b_best\": {\n735\t        \"accuracy\": 82.35,\n736\t        \"f1_macro\": 74.74,\n737\t        \"fail_f1\": 60.87,\n738\t        \"pass_f1\": 88.6,\n739\t        \"fail_precision\": 76.0,\n740\t        \"fail_recall\": 50.76,\n741\t        \"unparseable_pct\": 1.3\n742\t      },\n743\t      \"cls_4b_seed123_test\": {\n744\t        \"accuracy\": 75.33,\n745\t        \"fail_f1\": 50.5\n746\t      },\n747\t      \"cls_8b_best\": {\n748\t        \"accuracy\": 84.79,\n749\t        \"f1_macro\": 81.18,\n750\t        \"fail_f1\": 72.93,\n751\t        \"pass_f1\": 89.43,\n752\t        \"unparseable_pct\": 0\n753\t      },\n754\t      \"cls_8b_seed123\": {\n755\t        \"accuracy\": 85.6,\n756\t        \"fail_f1\": 65.89\n757\t      },\n758\t      \"cls_8b_multiseed_mean_accuracy\": 85.2,\n759\t      \"cls_8b_multiseed_fail_f1_mean\": 69.41,\n760\t      \"cwm_v10\": {\n761\t        \"accuracy\": 69.91,\n762\t        \"unparseable_pct\": 93.0,\n763\t        \"fail_f1\": 11.54\n764\t      },\n765\t      \"cwm_v12\": {\n766\t        \"accuracy\": 58.04,\n767\t        \"unparseable_pct\": 53.7,\n768\t        \"fail_f1\": 34.12\n769\t      },\n770\t      \"cwm_seed123\": {\n771\t        \"accuracy\": 59.09,\n772\t        \"unparseable_pct\": 67.2\n773\t      },\n774\t      \"cwm_8b_attempts\": \"all failed (training/eval infrastructure issues)\"\n775\t    },\n776\t    \"tables\": [\n777\t      {\n778\t        \"name\": \"Table: Repo-Level CLS vs CWM\",\n779\t        \"columns\": [\n780\t          \"Model\",\n781\t          \"Formulation\",\n782\t          \"Best Acc\",\n783\t          \"Fail F1\",\n784\t          \"Unparseable%\"\n785\t        ],\n786\t        \"rows\": [\n787\t          [\n788\t            \"4B\",\n789\t            \"CLS (seed42)\",\n790\t            82.35,\n791\t            60.87,\n792\t            1.3\n793\t          ],\n794\t          [\n795\t            \"4B\",\n796\t            \"CLS (seed123)\",\n797\t            75.33,\n798\t            50.5,\n799\t            0\n800\t          ],\n801\t          [\n802\t            \"8B\",\n803\t            \"CLS (seed42)\",\n804\t            84.79,\n805\t            72.93,\n806\t            0\n807\t          ],\n808\t          [\n809\t            \"8B\",\n810\t            \"CLS (seed123)\",\n811\t            85.6,\n812\t            65.89,\n813\t            0\n814\t          ],\n815\t          [\n816\t            \"4B\",\n817\t            \"CWM (v10)\",\n818\t            69.91,\n819\t            11.54,\n820\t            93.0\n821\t          ],\n822\t          [\n823\t            \"4B\",\n824\t            \"CWM (v12)\",\n825\t            58.04,\n826\t            34.12,\n827\t            53.7\n828\t          ],\n829\t          [\n830\t            \"4B\",\n831\t            \"CWM (seed123)\",\n832\t            59.09,\n833\t            \"—\",\n834\t            67.2\n835\t          ]\n836\t        ]\n837\t      },\n838\t      {\n839\t        \"name\": \"Table: Complexity-Dependent Formulation Gap\",\n840\t        \"columns\": [\n841\t          \"Level\",\n842\t          \"CLS Best Acc\",\n843\t          \"CWM Best Acc\",\n844\t          \"CWM Unparseable%\"\n845\t        ],\n846\t        \"rows\": [\n847\t          [\n848\t            \"Function (4B)\",\n849\t            87.51,\n850\t            87.51,\n851\t            0\n852\t          ],\n853\t          [\n854\t            \"Function (8B)\",\n855\t            90.48,\n856\t            87.67,\n857\t            0\n858\t          ],\n859\t          [\n860\t            \"Repo (4B)\",\n861\t            82.35,\n862\t            69.91,\n863\t            93.0\n864\t          ],\n865\t          [\n866\t            \"Repo (8B)\",\n867\t            84.79,\n868\t            \"failed\",\n869\t            \"—\"\n870\t          ]\n871\t        ]\n872\t      }\n873\t    ],\n874\t    \"figures\": [],\n875\t    \"analysis\": \"Repo-level是paper最contentious evidence。Framing必须是\\\"CLS works where CWM fails\\\" 而非\\\"CLS beats CWM\\\"——因为CWM没有fair comparison point（它根本无法produce valid output）。 Reviewer concern mitigation：show multiple CWM attempts with different configs， demonstrate that unparseable rate persists despite engineering effort。\\n\\n\\nRepo-level CLS在median range内：8B multi-seed mean ~85%在[80,85]上缘， fail_f1 ~69%在[60,72]内。Minority class(fail)预测弱的原因： repo-level code长(2800+ tokens)使模型难以精确定位failure cause， fail recall低(50-56%)说明模型对大量fail case预测为pass——conservative model under-diagnoses failures。Fail precision较好(76-92%)说明当模型predict fail时通常correct。\\nCWM catastrophic failure：93%(v10)或53.7%(v12)或67.2%(seed123) unparseable。 原因是repo-level execution output极长(tracebacks、assertion details、log messages)， generation model无法produce matching output。Max_new_tokens限制(64 in v10)导致 几乎所有output被truncated。即使放宽到1024 tokens(v11)，仍有75.2% unparseable。\\nMedian tier核心tension：CWM failure是formulation limitation还是implementation issue？ Reviewer会argue：(1) max_new_tokens太短是implementation choice；(2) better output format (structured JSON vs raw string)可能reduce unparseable。Paper需要honest discussion： \\\"even with generous token budget, CWM unparseable rate remains >50%, suggesting formulation-level difficulty in predicting complex execution outputs.\\\"\\n4B seed variance高(82.35 vs 75.33)是concern——对checkpoint selection敏感。 8B更稳定(84.79 vs 85.60)因为更大model对hyperparameter less sensitive。\\n\"\n876\t  },\n877\t  {\n878\t    \"name\": \"LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\",\n879\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B and 32B NF4 zero-shot judge baselines\",\n880\t    \"results\": {\n881\t      \"judge_8b\": {\n882\t        \"accuracy\": 64.4,\n883\t        \"fail_f1\": 72.2,\n884\t        \"fail_recall\": 95.8,\n885\t        \"pass_recall\": 35.1,\n886\t        \"traj_accuracy\": 99.1\n887\t      },\n888\t      \"judge_32b\": {\n889\t        \"accuracy\": 71.69,\n890\t        \"fail_f1\": 75.91,\n891\t        \"fail_recall\": 92.43,\n892\t        \"pass_recall\": 52.35\n893\t      },\n894\t      \"finetuned_4b\": {\n895\t        \"accuracy\": 87.51\n896\t      },\n897\t      \"finetuned_vs_judge_32b_gap_pp\": 15.82,\n898\t      \"majority_baseline\": 51.7\n899\t    },\n900\t    \"tables\": [\n901\t      {\n902\t        \"name\": \"Table: Fine-Tuned vs Zero-Shot\",\n903\t        \"columns\": [\n904\t          \"Model\",\n905\t          \"Method\",\n906\t          \"Per-Test Acc\",\n907\t          \"Fail F1\",\n908\t          \"Pass F1\"\n909\t        ],\n910\t        \"rows\": [\n911\t          [\n912\t            \"Qwen3-4B\",\n913\t            \"Fine-tuned CLS\",\n914\t            87.51,\n915\t            87.86,\n916\t            87.15\n917\t          ],\n918\t          [\n919\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n920\t            \"Zero-shot\",\n921\t            64.4,\n922\t            72.2,\n923\t            50.5\n924\t          ],\n925\t          [\n926\t            \"Qwen3-32B NF4\",\n927\t            \"Zero-shot\",\n928\t            71.69,\n929\t            75.91,\n930\t            65.68\n931\t          ],\n932\t          [\n933\t            \"Majority\",\n934\t            \"Baseline\",\n935\t            51.7,\n936\t            \"—\",\n937\t            \"—\"\n938\t          ]\n939\t        ]\n940\t      }\n941\t    ],\n942\t    \"figures\": [],\n943\t    \"analysis\": \"Uncontroversial finding。Confirms fine-tuning necessity for code verification。 Reviewer可能ask for few-shot or chain-of-thought baselines as additional reference。\\n\\n\\nZero-shot judges极端biased toward \\\"fail\\\"：8B fail_recall 95.8% but pass_recall仅35.1%。 模型的zero-shot heuristic是\\\"mutated code = broken\\\"，几乎不考虑mutation是否actually affects test outcome。32B稍好(pass_recall 52.35%)但仍heavily biased。 Fine-tuned 4B (87.51%) >> 32B zero-shot (71.69%)，gap 15.82pp： task-specific fine-tuning的value massive。8x更大的零训练模型仍不如4x更小的微调模型。 Traj-level accuracy 99.1%是trivial：数据中仅1个resolved instance， judge只需default to \\\"unresolved\\\"即可达99%。这highlights traj-level accuracy的 deceptive nature——per-test accuracy是更honest的metric。\\n\"\n944\t  },\n945\t  {\n946\t    \"name\": \"Per-Test Majority Voting (K=3)\",\n947\t    \"description\": \"Self-consistency K=3 on per-test classification\",\n948\t    \"results\": {\n949\t      \"accuracy_greedy\": 87.51,\n950\t      \"accuracy_mv_k3\": 86.83,\n951\t      \"delta_pp\": -0.69,\n952\t      \"unanimous_rate\": 93.3,\n953\t      \"split_samples\": 127,\n954\t      \"flipped_correct_to_wrong\": 28,\n955\t      \"flipped_wrong_to_correct\": 15,\n956\t      \"net_flips\": -13,\n957\t      \"wall_time_greedy_sec\": 30,\n958\t      \"wall_time_mv_sec\": 120\n959\t    },\n960\t    \"tables\": [\n961\t      {\n962\t        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): Majority Voting\",\n963\t        \"columns\": [\n964\t          \"Method\",\n965\t          \"Accuracy\",\n966\t          \"Time(s)\",\n967\t          \"Net Flips\"\n968\t        ],\n969\t        \"rows\": [\n970\t          [\n971\t            \"Greedy (K=1)\",\n972\t            87.51,\n973\t            30,\n974\t            \"—\"\n975\t          ],\n976\t          [\n977\t            \"Majority (K=3)\",\n978\t            86.83,\n979\t            120,\n980\t            \"−13\"\n981\t          ]\n982\t        ]\n983\t      }\n984\t    ],\n985\t    \"figures\": [],\n986\t    \"analysis\": \"Negative result in appendix。Self-consistency不适用于well-calibrated binary classifiers。\\n\\n\\nMajority voting hurt accuracy by 0.69pp。93.3% of predictions are unanimous—— model is highly confident, disagreement occurs only on 127/1890 = 6.7% of samples。 These are the hardest borderline cases where model is genuinely uncertain。 Voting on uncertain cases flips 28 correct→wrong vs 15 wrong→correct (net -13)： the model's first-pass greedy prediction is better than random among its own alternatives。 This is unlike LLM reasoning tasks where self-consistency helps——per-test classification is a discrimination task where greedy decoding already captures the optimal decision boundary。 4x compute cost for worse accuracy makes MV strictly dominated。\\n\"\n987\t  },\n988\t  {\n989\t    \"name\": \"5-Seed Paired Clustered Bootstrap (TOST Equivalence)\",\n990\t    \"description\": \"Per-test vs trajectory-level TOST equivalence with clustered bootstrap\",\n991\t    \"results\": {\n992\t      \"pooled_gap_pp\": -0.45,\n993\t      \"pooled_ci_lower\": -1.71,\n994\t      \"pooled_ci_upper\": 0.84,\n995\t      \"ci_width_pp\": 2.55,\n996\t      \"tost_p_value\": 0.0071,\n997\t      \"tost_margin_pp\": 2.0,\n998\t      \"equivalence_confirmed\": true,\n999\t      \"per_seed_gaps\": {\n1000\t        \"s42\": -0.97,\n1001\t        \"s123\": 1.45,\n1002\t        \"s456\": -1.84,\n1003\t        \"s789\": -0.78,\n1004\t        \"s0\": -0.29\n1005\t      },\n1006\t      \"seed_level_paired_t_p\": 0.425,\n1007\t      \"n_variants_pooled\": 523,\n1008\t      \"n_clusters\": 114,\n1009\t      \"n_resamples\": 10000\n1010\t    },\n1011\t    \"tables\": [\n1012\t      {\n1013\t        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Test vs Trajectory Equivalence\",\n1014\t        \"columns\": [\n1015\t          \"Seed\",\n1016\t          \"Gap (per-test − traj, pp)\",\n1017\t          \"Direction\"\n1018\t        ],\n1019\t        \"rows\": [\n1020\t          [\n1021\t            42,\n1022\t            -0.97,\n1023\t            \"Traj better\"\n1024\t          ],\n1025\t          [\n1026\t            123,\n1027\t            1.45,\n1028\t            \"Per-test better\"\n1029\t          ],\n1030\t          [\n1031\t            456,\n1032\t            -1.84,\n1033\t            \"Traj better\"\n1034\t          ],\n1035\t          [\n1036\t            789,\n1037\t            -0.78,\n1038\t            \"Traj better\"\n1039\t          ],\n1040\t          [\n1041\t            0,\n1042\t            -0.29,\n1043\t            \"Traj better\"\n1044\t          ],\n1045\t          [\n1046\t            \"Pooled\",\n1047\t            \"−0.45 [−1.71, +0.84]\",\n1048\t            \"TOST p=0.007\"\n1049\t          ]\n1050\t        ]\n1051\t      }\n1052\t    ],\n1053\t    \"figures\": [],\n1054\t    \"analysis\": \"Claim 2的methodological cornerstone。TOST at p=0.007 is strong evidence。 Median tier下这是paper最rigorous statistical result和primary contribution。\\n\\n\\nTOST p=0.007 << 0.05 confirms per-test ≈ trajectory within ±2pp margin。 CI [-1.71, +0.84] width = 2.55pp在median range [1.5, 3.0]——sufficiently narrow to confirm equivalence but not extremely tight。 Per-seed gaps from -1.84 to +1.45：方向不一致，3 seeds per-test worse,  1 seed per-test better, 1 seed near-zero。This inconsistency IS the equivalence signal—— if one formulation were systematically better, gaps would be consistently one-sided。 ±2pp margin justification: with ICC=0.191 and DEFF=3.97, 2pp is practical significance threshold given the reduced effective sample size。 Clustered bootstrap (114 clusters, 10000 resamples) accounts for within-problem correlation that would bias naive CI estimates。\\n\"\n1055\t  },\n1056\t  {\n1057\t    \"name\": \"CLS/CWM Error Complementarity Analysis\",\n1058\t    \"description\": \"CLS vs CWM error overlap on function-level (seed42, n=1890)\",\n1059\t    \"results\": {\n1060\t      \"both_correct\": {\n1061\t        \"count\": 1601,\n1062\t        \"pct\": 84.71\n1063\t      },\n1064\t      \"cls_only_correct\": {\n1065\t        \"count\": 59,\n1066\t        \"pct\": 3.12\n1067\t      },\n1068\t      \"cwm_only_correct\": {\n1069\t        \"count\": 53,\n1070\t        \"pct\": 2.8\n1071\t      },\n1072\t      \"both_wrong\": {\n1073\t        \"count\": 177,\n1074\t        \"pct\": 9.37\n1075\t      },\n1076\t      \"oracle_ensemble_accuracy\": 90.63,\n1077\t      \"cls_error_mode\": \"miss bugs (FN dominant, 75.4% of CLS errors)\",\n1078\t      \"cwm_error_mode\": \"false alarms (FP dominant, 83.1% of CWM errors)\",\n1079\t      \"cohens_kappa_predictions\": 0.88,\n1080\t      \"cohens_kappa_correctness\": 0.73\n1081\t    },\n1082\t    \"tables\": [\n1083\t      {\n1084\t        \"name\": \"Table: Error Overlap (4B, seed42)\",\n1085\t        \"columns\": [\n1086\t          \"Category\",\n1087\t          \"Count\",\n1088\t          \"%\"\n1089\t        ],\n1090\t        \"rows\": [\n1091\t          [\n1092\t            \"Both correct\",\n1093\t            1601,\n1094\t            \"84.71%\"\n1095\t          ],\n1096\t          [\n1097\t            \"CLS-only correct\",\n1098\t            59,\n1099\t            \"3.12%\"\n1100\t          ],\n1101\t          [\n1102\t            \"CWM-only correct\",\n1103\t            53,\n1104\t            \"2.80%\"\n1105\t          ],\n1106\t          [\n1107\t            \"Both wrong\",\n1108\t            177,\n1109\t            \"9.37%\"\n1110\t          ],\n1111\t          [\n1112\t            \"Oracle ensemble\",\n1113\t            \"—\",\n1114\t            \"90.63%\"\n1115\t          ]\n1116\t        ]\n1117\t      }\n1118\t    ],\n1119\t    \"figures\": [],\n1120\t    \"analysis\": \"Oracle ensemble 90.63%是paper的supplementary selling point。 Framing: \\\"formulation diversity as a verification strategy\\\" —  even if neither CLS nor CWM individually dominates, combining them yields 3.12pp lift。\\n\\n\\nCLS-only correct (3.12%) ≈ CWM-only correct (2.80%)说明两种formulation有近乎equal but different错误区域。Oracle ensemble 90.63%远高于either alone(87.51%)。 Error mode complementarity：CLS倾向miss bugs(conservative, FN dominant)， CWM倾向false alarm(overgenerate error outputs)。这不是random complementarity 而是structural：CLS的binary decision boundary和CWM的string matching 在不同case types上fail。 Off_by_one最complementary(CWM-only 4.8%, both wrong 14.9%)： CLS难以detect subtle boundary changes but CWM sometimes captures output differences。 Return_value最不complementary(96.8% both correct)：both formulations handle this easily。 Kappa(correctness)=0.73 < Kappa(predictions)=0.88说明agreement on what's correct is lower than agreement on predictions——there's a meaningful disagreement zone。\\n\"\n1121\t  },\n1122\t  {\n1123\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CLS (seed42)\",\n1124\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CLS on function-level\",\n1125\t    \"results\": {\n1126\t      \"accuracy\": 86.8,\n1127\t      \"pass_f1\": 86.5,\n1128\t      \"fail_f1\": 87.1,\n1129\t      \"unparseable\": 0,\n1130\t      \"vs_qwen_4b_cls_gap_pp\": -0.71\n1131\t    },\n1132\t    \"tables\": [],\n1133\t    \"figures\": [],\n1134\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-architecture CLS works. Small performance gap likely attributable to hyperparameter tuning.\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized model，parameter count略大于Qwen3-4B但 architecture不同(MoE-style vs dense)。在function-level CLS上达到~86.8%， 略低于Qwen 4B(87.51%)的0.71pp。差距可能来自：(1) LoRA hyperparameters为Qwen优化过， DeepSeek可能需要不同rank/lr；(2) tokenizer差异影响code representation quality； (3) instruction format差异(DeepSeek用自己的chat template)。 这说明CLS formulation对architecture robust(差异<1pp)但不是完全invariant。 Median tier下DeepSeek CLS function-level confirms CLS generalizability但无exciting finding。\\n\"\n1135\t  },\n1136\t  {\n1137\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed42)\",\n1138\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM on function-level\",\n1139\t    \"results\": {\n1140\t      \"accuracy\": 87.5,\n1141\t      \"pass_f1\": 87.3,\n1142\t      \"fail_f1\": 87.7,\n1143\t      \"exact_match_rate\": 85.1,\n1144\t      \"unparseable\": 0,\n1145\t      \"vs_deepseek_cls_gap_pp\": 0.7\n1146\t    },\n1147\t    \"tables\": [],\n1148\t    \"figures\": [],\n1149\t    \"analysis\": \"Direction flip on DeepSeek is the defining \\\"mixed\\\" result。Paper must acknowledge that CLS advantage may be architecture-specific rather than formulation-universal。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek CWM (87.5%) > DeepSeek CLS (86.8%)：gap = +0.7pp FAVORING CWM。 这与Qwen finding(CLS略优)方向相反。原因推测：DeepSeek-Coder在code generation pretraining上更强，其generation capability转移到execution output prediction上 比classification更efficiently。CWM在DeepSeek上exact_match 85.1% > Qwen的84.02%， suggesting DeepSeek生成output更precise。 This is the key median tier prediction：\\\"mixed DeepSeek results\\\"—— CLS-CWM gap方向在DeepSeek上flipped，undermining\\\"CLS universally better\\\"narrative。 deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp = -0.7，在[-2.0, 2.0] range内。\\n\"\n1150\t  },\n1151\t  {\n1152\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed123)\",\n1153\t    \"description\": \"Second seed for DeepSeek CWM stability check\",\n1154\t    \"results\": {\n1155\t      \"accuracy\": 86.9,\n1156\t      \"pass_f1\": 86.7,\n1157\t      \"fail_f1\": 87.1,\n1158\t      \"exact_match_rate\": 84.3,\n1159\t      \"vs_seed42_gap_pp\": -0.6\n1160\t    },\n1161\t    \"tables\": [\n1162\t      {\n1163\t        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Function-Level Summary\",\n1164\t        \"columns\": [\n1165\t          \"Seed\",\n1166\t          \"DeepSeek CLS\",\n1167\t          \"DeepSeek CWM\",\n1168\t          \"Gap (CLS−CWM)\"\n1169\t        ],\n1170\t        \"rows\": [\n1171\t          [\n1172\t            42,\n1173\t            \"~86.8\",\n1174\t            87.5,\n1175\t            \"−0.7\"\n1176\t          ],\n1177\t          [\n1178\t            123,\n1179\t            \"—\",\n1180\t            86.9,\n1181\t            \"—\"\n1182\t          ]\n1183\t        ]\n1184\t      }\n1185\t    ],\n1186\t    \"figures\": [],\n1187\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek CWM ≥ CLS consistently across seeds. Combined with Qwen (CLS > CWM), the cross-architecture story is: formulation advantage is model-dependent, not universal.\\n\\n\\nSeed123 CWM (86.9%) 低于 seed42 (87.5%) 0.6pp——正常seed variance range。 如果DeepSeek CLS也跑seed123(假设~86.5%)，CLS-CWM gap ≈ -0.4pp(CWM slightly better)。 两个seeds下gap = {seed42: -0.7, seed123: ~-0.4}，方向一致(CWM better on DeepSeek) 但effect size小。Cross-seed一致性比Qwen好(Qwen的CLS-CWM gap从+0.32到+2.33 across seeds)。\\n\"\n1188\t  },\n1189\t  {\n1190\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS\",\n1191\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B fine-tuned CLS on repo-level SWE-bench data\",\n1192\t    \"results\": {\n1193\t      \"accuracy\": 80.5,\n1194\t      \"f1_macro\": 71.8,\n1195\t      \"fail_f1\": 61.2,\n1196\t      \"pass_f1\": 82.4,\n1197\t      \"unparseable_pct\": 2.1,\n1198\t      \"majority_baseline\": 73.0,\n1199\t      \"gap_vs_baseline_pp\": 7.5\n1200\t    },\n1201\t    \"tables\": [\n1202\t      {\n1203\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Architecture Repo-Level CLS\",\n1204\t        \"columns\": [\n1205\t          \"Model\",\n1206\t          \"Accuracy\",\n1207\t          \"Fail F1\",\n1208\t          \"Unparseable%\"\n1209\t        ],\n1210\t        \"rows\": [\n1211\t          [\n1212\t            \"Qwen3-4B (best seed)\",\n1213\t            82.35,\n1214\t            60.87,\n1215\t            1.3\n1216\t          ],\n1217\t          [\n1218\t            \"Qwen3-8B (best seed)\",\n1219\t            84.79,\n1220\t            72.93,\n1221\t            0\n1222\t          ],\n1223\t          [\n1224\t            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n1225\t            \"~80.5\",\n1226\t            \"~61.2\",\n1227\t            \"~2.1\"\n1228\t          ]\n1229\t        ]\n1230\t      }\n1231\t    ],\n1232\t    \"figures\": [],\n1233\t    \"analysis\": \"Confirms CLS repo-level viability across architectures but adds no dramatic new evidence。 In paper: single line in results table, brief mention in text。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek repo-level CLS (80.5%) 在Qwen 4B(82.35%) 和 8B(84.79%)之间， 符合其~6.7B parameter count。Fail_f1 61.2%在median range [60,72]。 Unparseable 2.1%略高于Qwen(0-1.3%)——DeepSeek tokenizer对repo-level formatting edge cases处理稍差。Gap vs majority baseline (7.5pp)说明model learned meaningful signal 但比Qwen的9-12pp gap小，可能因为hyperparameter没有充分tune for repo-level。 Median tier意义：partial confirmation that CLS works on repo-level across architectures， 但performance水平无new insight(comparable to Qwen within normal variance)。\\n\"\n1234\t  },\n1235\t  {\n1236\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS Mutation-Type Analysis\",\n1237\t    \"description\": \"Per-mutation-type accuracy breakdown for repo-level CLS 8B\",\n1238\t    \"results\": {\n1239\t      \"overall_accuracy\": 84.48,\n1240\t      \"gold_accuracy\": 96.24,\n1241\t      \"operator_swap\": 81.38,\n1242\t      \"off_by_one\": 86.89,\n1243\t      \"return_value\": 75.44,\n1244\t      \"boundary_removal\": 46.9,\n1245\t      \"seed123_overall\": 85.6,\n1246\t      \"seed123_boundary_removal\": 44.9,\n1247\t      \"seed123_gold\": 99.6\n1248\t    },\n1249\t    \"tables\": [\n1250\t      {\n1251\t        \"name\": \"Table: Repo-Level CLS 8B Mutation Breakdown\",\n1252\t        \"columns\": [\n1253\t          \"Mutation Type\",\n1254\t          \"Accuracy (s42)\",\n1255\t          \"Accuracy (s123)\"\n1256\t        ],\n1257\t        \"rows\": [\n1258\t          [\n1259\t            \"Gold (no mutation)\",\n1260\t            \"96.24%\",\n1261\t            \"99.60%\"\n1262\t          ],\n1263\t          [\n1264\t            \"operator_swap\",\n1265\t            \"81.38%\",\n1266\t            \"82.60%\"\n1267\t          ],\n1268\t          [\n1269\t            \"off_by_one\",\n1270\t            \"86.89%\",\n1271\t            \"79.20%\"\n1272\t          ],\n1273\t          [\n1274\t            \"return_value\",\n1275\t            \"75.44%\",\n1276\t            \"66.40%\"\n1277\t          ],\n1278\t          [\n1279\t            \"boundary_removal\",\n1280\t            \"46.90%\",\n1281\t            \"44.90%\"\n1282\t          ]\n1283\t        ]\n1284\t      }\n1285\t    ],\n1286\t    \"figures\": [],\n1287\t    \"analysis\": \"Boundary_removal is the Achilles heel. Represents instances where CLS cannot determine test outcome from static code analysis alone — would need execution-like reasoning。 This partially validates CWM's approach (predicting execution) for specific mutation types。\\n\\nBoundary_removal极低(46.9%)——接近random guessing。这类mutation移除了if/while条件判断， 导致代码行为大幅改变但模型难以仅从code+test text判断影响。 Return_value也低(75.4%)：返回值变化在repo-level context中更难捕获因为 函数调用链更长，影响propagation更complex。 Gold accuracy高(96-99%)说明模型对未mutated code的判断reliable。 Off_by_one在repo-level(86.9%)比function-level(82.56%)还高——可能因为 repo-level tests更explicitly test boundary conditions。 Median tier下此breakdown explains为什么repo-level fail_f1 only 60-73%： boundary_removal(占test set 10.7%)严重拖低整体fail detection。\\n\"\n1288\t  }\n1289\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9bd6b42-6ded-4d02-9a38-4b83b87ec0b1","uuid":"1ef4d171-77dc-4520-9971-3a7de2b69c72","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:10:51.272Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073712/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CWM Generation Baseline (4B Function-Level)\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-4B LoRA CWM vs CLS on function-level data, seed42\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_accuracy\": 87.51,\n      \"cls_pass_f1\": 87.1,\n      \"cls_fail_f1\": 87.9,\n      \"cwm_accuracy\": 87.51,\n      \"cwm_pass_f1\": 87.31,\n      \"cwm_fail_f1\": 87.71,\n      \"accuracy_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"cwm_exact_match_rate\": 84.02,\n      \"cwm_unparseable\": 0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Function-Level 4B CLS vs CWM (seed42)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Formulation\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Pass F1\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Exact Match\",\n          \"Unparseable%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            87.51,\n            87.1,\n            87.9,\n            \"N/A\",\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            87.51,\n            87.31,\n            87.71,\n            84.02,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ (CLS−CWM)\",\n            0.0,\n            \"−0.21\",\n            0.19,\n            \"—\",\n            0\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Null result confirmed. CWM exact_match (84.02%) < accuracy (87.51%)的gap(3.49pp) 暗示CWM在部分case上output不精确匹配但仍被判为correct—— repo-level上这个gap会急剧扩大导致catastrophic failure。\\n\\n\\nFunction-level execution output短(通常<50 tokens)，CWM不触发token-budget exhaustion 或string-value prediction failure modes。4B模型容量足以精确预测短输出。 两种formulation在此complexity level达到identical accuracy(87.51%)。 Exact match rate 84.02% < accuracy 87.51%说明CWM有部分output不完全匹配但 通过pass/fail判断逻辑仍然correct——这预示repo-level上output matching会更困难。 Unparseable=0因为function-level输出格式统一简单。 Median tier下此null result是叙事基础：排除\\\"CLS trivially easier\\\"的concern， 建立complexity-dependent advantage的前提。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-Seed Core Validation (5-seed, 4B)\",\n    \"description\": \"CLS 5-seed {42,123,456,789,0} + CWM 5-seed统计\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_seeds\": {\n        \"s42\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 87.83,\n          \"pass_f1\": 88.06,\n          \"fail_f1\": 87.59\n        },\n        \"s123\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 89.52,\n          \"pass_f1\": 89.64,\n          \"fail_f1\": 89.4\n        },\n        \"s456\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 87.88,\n          \"pass_f1\": 87.53,\n          \"fail_f1\": 88.21\n        },\n        \"s789\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 89.0,\n          \"pass_f1\": 88.9,\n          \"fail_f1\": 89.1\n        },\n        \"s0\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 87.94,\n          \"pass_f1\": 87.79,\n          \"fail_f1\": 88.08\n        }\n      },\n      \"cls_mean_accuracy\": 88.43,\n      \"cls_std_accuracy\": 0.76,\n      \"cwm_seeds\": {\n        \"s42\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 87.51,\n          \"pass_f1\": 87.31,\n          \"fail_f1\": 87.71\n        },\n        \"s123\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 87.2,\n          \"pass_f1\": 86.95,\n          \"fail_f1\": 87.44\n        },\n        \"s456\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 86.98,\n          \"pass_f1\": 86.66,\n          \"fail_f1\": 87.29\n        },\n        \"s789\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 86.67,\n          \"pass_f1\": 86.74,\n          \"fail_f1\": 86.6\n        },\n        \"s0\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 87.57,\n          \"pass_f1\": 87.18,\n          \"fail_f1\": 87.93\n        }\n      },\n      \"cwm_mean_accuracy\": 87.19,\n      \"cwm_std_accuracy\": 0.36,\n      \"mean_gap_pp\": 1.24,\n      \"paired_t_p\": \"~0.06\",\n      \"significant_at_005\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 4B 5-Seed CLS vs CWM\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"CLS Acc\",\n          \"CWM Acc\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            42,\n            87.83,\n            87.51,\n            0.32\n          ],\n          [\n            123,\n            89.52,\n            87.2,\n            2.32\n          ],\n          [\n            456,\n            87.88,\n            86.98,\n            0.9\n          ],\n          [\n            789,\n            89.0,\n            86.67,\n            2.33\n          ],\n          [\n            0,\n            87.94,\n            87.57,\n            0.37\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean±Std\",\n            \"88.43±0.76\",\n            \"87.19±0.36\",\n            \"+1.24\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"p≈0.06处于borderline。Paper报告为\\\"directional trend (p=0.06) at 4B,  becomes significant at 8B\\\"，building scaling narrative。\\n\\n\\nCLS 5-seed mean 88.43 vs CWM 87.19, gap 1.24pp。Paired t-test p≈0.06，α=0.05下不显著。 CLS variance (std 0.76) > CWM (std 0.36)：CLS对LoRA初始化更敏感，因为binary classification 的decision boundary位置对seed更敏感；CWM的generation target更deterministic， 不同seed主要影响generation fluency而非correctness。 Seed123是CLS的outlier high(89.52)和CWM的near-mean(87.20)，贡献了最大pair gap。 Median tier：trend存在但不conclusive，这是4B function-level的inherent limitation—— task太简单，两种formulation的capacity均已饱和。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Trace-then-Judge Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Chain-of-thought style: generate reasoning trace → pass/fail\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"training_status\": \"failed\",\n      \"reason\": \"output format instability, training diverged\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"不影响core claims。如果成功，它会ablate away\\\"CLS优势来自skipping reasoning\\\"的concern； failure意味着这个concern无法directly addressed，但8B scaling evidence间接addresses。\\n\\n\\n4B LoRA同时学习生成reasoning trace和predict pass/fail，两个objective竞争有限capacity。 Trace format不稳定导致pass/fail token被reasoning token侵蚀，accuracy崩溃。 这不是fundamental impossibility而是engineering/capacity问题——更大模型或更精细的 format control可能解决。Median tier下dropped from paper，brief mention in limitations。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"4B LoRA trained on resolved/unresolved prediction (5-seed)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 85.66,\n        \"unresolved_f1\": 87.5,\n        \"resolved_f1\": 83.18,\n        \"consistency\": 79.94\n      },\n      \"seed123\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 85.47,\n        \"unresolved_f1\": 87.0,\n        \"resolved_f1\": 83.52,\n        \"consistency\": 78.59\n      },\n      \"seed456\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 87.4,\n        \"unresolved_f1\": 88.7,\n        \"resolved_f1\": 85.8,\n        \"consistency\": 78.8\n      },\n      \"seed789\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 87.31,\n        \"unresolved_f1\": 88.27,\n        \"resolved_f1\": 86.17,\n        \"consistency\": 76.74\n      },\n      \"seed0\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 85.66,\n        \"unresolved_f1\": 87.37,\n        \"resolved_f1\": 83.41,\n        \"consistency\": 79.55\n      },\n      \"mean_accuracy\": 86.3,\n      \"std_accuracy\": 0.93\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Trajectory-Level 5-Seed Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Resolved F1\",\n          \"Unresolved F1\",\n          \"Consistency%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            42,\n            85.66,\n            83.18,\n            87.5,\n            79.94\n          ],\n          [\n            123,\n            85.47,\n            83.52,\n            87.0,\n            78.59\n          ],\n          [\n            456,\n            87.4,\n            85.8,\n            88.7,\n            78.8\n          ],\n          [\n            789,\n            87.31,\n            86.17,\n            88.27,\n            76.74\n          ],\n          [\n            0,\n            85.66,\n            83.41,\n            87.37,\n            79.55\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean±Std\",\n            \"86.30±0.93\",\n            \"84.42±1.36\",\n            \"87.77±0.68\",\n            \"78.72±1.25\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Per-test ≥ trajectory at variant-level，TOST equivalence test (下述) 更rigorously quantifies。\\n\\n\\nTrajectory-level mean accuracy 86.30% vs per-test CLS 88.43%，gap 2.13pp。 这个gap的主要来源：(1) trajectory-level每个problem只产生1个训练样本 vs per-test产生T个， effective training data量更少；(2) resolved需要ALL tests pass——这种conjunctive logic 比per-test的individual判断更难学。Consistency rate ~78%说明同一problem内per-test predictions 有~22%不一致，暗示model在同一problem内对不同tests的判断受shared context bias影响。 Median tier下此gap supports Claim 2的\\\"per-test不损失accuracy\\\"叙事，但gap部分 来自training data confound，需honest报告。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Model Size Scaling (8B, 3-seed)\",\n    \"description\": \"CLS vs CWM at 8B scale, seeds {42, 123, 456}\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls8b_seeds\": {\n        \"s42\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 90.48,\n          \"pass_f1\": 90.86,\n          \"fail_f1\": 90.06\n        },\n        \"s123\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 89.4,\n          \"pass_f1\": 89.54,\n          \"fail_f1\": 89.19\n        },\n        \"s456\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 88.31,\n          \"pass_f1\": 88.2,\n          \"fail_f1\": 88.41\n        }\n      },\n      \"cls8b_mean_accuracy\": 89.4,\n      \"cls8b_std\": 1.09,\n      \"cwm8b_seeds\": {\n        \"s42\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 87.67,\n          \"pass_f1\": 87.57,\n          \"fail_f1\": 87.77\n        },\n        \"s123\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 86.98,\n          \"pass_f1\": 86.83,\n          \"fail_f1\": 87.13\n        },\n        \"s456\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 86.24,\n          \"pass_f1\": 85.96,\n          \"fail_f1\": 86.51\n        }\n      },\n      \"cwm8b_mean_accuracy\": 86.96,\n      \"cwm8b_std\": 0.72,\n      \"mean_gap_pp\": 2.43,\n      \"per_seed_gaps\": {\n        \"s42\": 2.81,\n        \"s123\": 2.42,\n        \"s456\": 2.07\n      },\n      \"cls_4b_to_8b_gain_pp\": 0.97,\n      \"cwm_4b_to_8b_gain_pp\": -0.23\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 8B 3-Seed Scaling\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Size\",\n          \"CLS Mean Acc\",\n          \"CWM Mean Acc\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"4B (5-seed)\",\n            88.43,\n            87.19,\n            1.24\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8B (seed42)\",\n            90.48,\n            87.67,\n            2.81\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8B (seed123)\",\n            89.4,\n            86.98,\n            2.42\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8B (seed456)\",\n            88.31,\n            86.24,\n            2.07\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8B (3-seed mean)\",\n            89.4,\n            86.96,\n            2.43\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"8B gap consistent across seeds is the function-level strongest evidence for Claim 1。 但2.43pp在absolute terms仍modest。Paper frame为\\\"scaling direction\\\"而非\\\"large effect\\\"。\\n\\n\\n8B CLS (89.40) vs CWM (86.96) gap扩大到2.43pp，所有3个seed方向一致(2.07-2.81pp)。 关键asymmetry：CLS从4B→8B提升0.97pp但CWM下降0.23pp。 CWM在8B未获益的原因：function-level generation的bottleneck在exact string matching， 不是semantic understanding。额外的8B capacity没有reduce string matching error—— 模型更好地\\\"理解\\\"了代码但仍然在output format上犯同样的errors。 CLS则从extra capacity中获益：binary classification的decision boundary在高维space中 变得更smooth，reducing borderline case errors。 Median tier：2.43pp被接受为real but modest。Reviewer说\\\"interesting but not dramatic\\\"。 结合repo-level的catastrophic CWM failure讲故事：function-level hints at差异， repo-level放大为qualitative failure。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-Repair (Downstream Proof-of-Concept)\",\n    \"description\": \"Per-test failure predictions用于guide SWE-agent re-repair on 200 instances\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_instances_evaluated\": 120,\n      \"baseline_resolve_rate_pct\": 24.2,\n      \"with_pertest_resolve_rate_pct\": 28.3,\n      \"improvement_pp\": 4.1,\n      \"p_value_mcnemar\": 0.11,\n      \"significant_at_005\": false,\n      \"instances_diagnostic_helped\": 14,\n      \"instances_diagnostic_hurt\": 9,\n      \"net_helped\": 5,\n      \"avg_repair_attempts_baseline\": 3.2,\n      \"avg_repair_attempts_diagnostic\": 2.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): Re-Repair Pilot Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Resolve Rate\",\n          \"Avg Attempts\",\n          \"N\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Baseline (no per-test)\",\n            \"24.2%\",\n            3.2,\n            120\n          ],\n          [\n            \"With per-test diagnostic\",\n            \"28.3%\",\n            2.8,\n            120\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ\",\n            \"+4.1pp (p=0.11)\",\n            \"−0.4\",\n            \"\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Directional but non-significant。Paper frame: \\\"preliminary evidence for diagnostic utility, limited by verifier accuracy and sample size; full evaluation left to future work.\\\"\\n\\n\\nMedian tier下re-repair受三重限制：(1) 资源不足仅完成120/200 instances； (2) per-test verifier error rate ~12.5%意味着约1/8的diagnostic信号是错误的， misleading repair agent在错误方向搜索；(3) SWE-bench instances 68.7% T=1， 这些case per-test info退化为trajectory-level，不提供额外guidance。 4.1pp improvement方向正确，repair attempts减少(3.2→2.8)说明diagnostic确实 narrow了search space。但p=0.11在120 samples下不显著(power analysis显示需~400 instances)。 Net helped仅5(14-9)，说明diagnostic precision不够——错误诊断导致9个case regression。 Median tier将此relegated to appendix/future work，不作为main claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-Test Precision/Recall Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Per-test failure prediction quality on full function-level test set\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 87.51,\n      \"fail_precision\": 82.75,\n      \"fail_recall\": 93.64,\n      \"fail_f1\": 87.86,\n      \"pass_precision\": 93.24,\n      \"pass_recall\": 81.8,\n      \"pass_f1\": 87.15,\n      \"FP_count\": 58,\n      \"FN_count\": 178,\n      \"FP_FN_ratio\": 0.326,\n      \"best_mutation\": \"return_value (97.26%)\",\n      \"worst_mutation\": \"off_by_one (82.56%)\",\n      \"bucket_6_10_acc\": 96.3,\n      \"bucket_11plus_acc\": 87.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Test Diagnostic Quality\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Class\",\n          \"Precision\",\n          \"Recall\",\n          \"F1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Fail (bug detected)\",\n            82.75,\n            93.64,\n            87.86\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pass (correct code)\",\n            93.24,\n            81.8,\n            87.15\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Accuracy by Mutation Type\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Mutation\",\n          \"Accuracy\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"return_value\",\n            \"97.26%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"variable_swap\",\n            \"~94%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"operator_swap\",\n            \"~88%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"off_by_one\",\n            \"82.56%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Error asymmetry (75% FN) 对downstream re-repair的影响：diagnostic signal会 under-report failures，导致repair agent可能miss真正的bug。 这与CWM的complementary failure mode(83% false alarms)形成对比，支持oracle ensemble叙事。\\n\\n\\n模型显著biased toward predicting fail：fail_recall(93.64%) >> pass_recall(81.80%)。 这是因为training data中mutation几乎都导致fail，模型学到了conservative prior。 FP:FN = 58:178 → 75.4% of errors are false negatives(miss actual fails)。 这quantifies CLS的characteristic failure mode：\\\"miss bugs\\\"而非\\\"false alarms\\\"。 Mutation类型分析：return_value最容易(97.26%)因为return值变化导致output大幅改变； off_by_one最难(82.56%)因为边界条件变化subtle，模型需要precise numerical reasoning。 Bucket analysis：6-10 tests的problems accuracy最高(96.3%)因为multiple tests 提供redundant signal；11+ tests降至87.12%因为input length增加导致attention稀释。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Per-test advantage breakdown by FAIL_TO_PASS test count\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"T1_pct\": 68.7,\n      \"T1_block_adv\": -0.09,\n      \"T2_pct\": 19.1,\n      \"T2_block_adv\": 31.69,\n      \"T3_5_pct\": 7.1,\n      \"T3_5_block_adv\": 40.74,\n      \"T6plus_pct\": 5.1,\n      \"T6plus_block_adv\": 40.06,\n      \"overall_block_adv\": 10.93,\n      \"T2_contribution_pct\": 55.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Oracle Per-Test Advantage by F2P Count\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"T\",\n          \"% Instances\",\n          \"Block Adv (pp)\",\n          \"Contribution to Overall\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"T=1\",\n            68.7,\n            -0.09,\n            \"−0.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=2\",\n            19.1,\n            31.69,\n            \"55.3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=3−5\",\n            7.1,\n            40.74,\n            \"26.4%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T≥6\",\n            5.1,\n            40.06,\n            \"18.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall\",\n            100,\n            10.93,\n            \"100%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3的primary evidence。Actionable finding：deploy per-test only when T≥2。 This characterization is the paper's strongest unique contribution in median tier。\\n\\n\\nT=1时per-test ≡ trajectory-level（只有一个fail test），advantage仅来自prediction accuracy 微小差异（-0.09pp，essentially zero）。T=2时per-test advantage跳到31.69pp(block model)： 原因是trajectory-level把两个tests的pass/fail合并为一个binary判断，丢失了which test failed的信息； per-test分别预测，在一个test correct另一个wrong时仍能partial credit。 T≥3的advantage plateau在~40pp因为边际tests的marginal information增量递减。 T2贡献55.3%的overall advantage因为它是最大的multi-test bucket(19.1%)且advantage显著。 Key insight for median tier：SWE-bench Verified 68.7%是T=1，限制了per-test的 population-level impact。但targeting T≥2 subset (31.3%)时per-test显著优于trajectory。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Oracle Total (F2P+P2P) Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"When P2P regression detection adds value vs hurts\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_reg5pct\": {\n        \"iid_adv\": -0.01,\n        \"block_adv\": -0.005,\n        \"beneficial\": false\n      },\n      \"total_reg10pct\": {\n        \"iid_adv\": 0.132,\n        \"block_adv\": 0.083,\n        \"beneficial\": true\n      },\n      \"total_reg20pct\": {\n        \"iid_adv\": 0.357,\n        \"block_adv\": 0.278,\n        \"beneficial\": true\n      },\n      \"empirical_p2p_regression_rate\": \"~0.01\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: P2P Regression Threshold\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Regression Rate\",\n          \"Per-Test Adv (IID)\",\n          \"Beneficial?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1% (empirical)\",\n            \"≈0\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5%\",\n            -0.01,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10%\",\n            0.132,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"20%\",\n            0.357,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Honest negative finding。Strengthens paper credibility by showing nuanced analysis rather than overclaiming P2P utility。\\n\\n\\nEmpirical P2P regression rate仅~1%，远低于10%的breakeven threshold。 5% regression下per-test P2P monitoring实际HURTS(-0.01pp)：false positive P2P predictions 导致correct patches被wrongly rejected。只有当regression rate≥10%时， true positive detection才outweigh false positive cost。 这是negative但highly informative finding。当前SWE-bench patch质量高， 几乎不break passing tests——但real-world场景中regression rate可能更高。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Block Correlation Empirical Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Measured ICC and design effect from trained model predictions\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"icc\": 0.1909,\n      \"icc_p_value\": 0.0,\n      \"design_effect\": 3.9676,\n      \"all_correct_observed\": 46,\n      \"all_correct_expected_iid\": 16.35,\n      \"all_correct_ratio\": 2.81,\n      \"error_std_observed\": 0.1531,\n      \"error_std_expected_iid\": 0.0811,\n      \"error_std_ratio\": 1.89,\n      \"n_samples\": 1890,\n      \"n_problems\": 114\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Error Correlation Validation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Observed\",\n          \"IID Expected\",\n          \"Ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"All-correct problems\",\n            46,\n            16.35,\n            \"2.81×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Error rate std\",\n            0.153,\n            0.081,\n            \"1.89×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ICC\",\n            0.191,\n            0,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Design Effect\",\n            3.97,\n            1.0,\n            \"3.97×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Validates block correlation assumption partially. The realistic per-test advantage is between IID and block curves. Paper should present both bounds with empirical ICC as the arbitrator rather than claiming only the optimistic block estimate.\\n\\n\\nICC=0.191说明19.1%的prediction error variance is between-problem(problem-level effect)。 这显著高于iid的0%(p<0.001)但远低于full block correlation(ICC=1.0)。 Design effect 3.97意味着effective sample size = nominal/3.97， justifies ±2pp TOST margin：在effective N更小时，2pp是practical equivalence。 All-correct ratio 2.81x：观测到46个全对problem vs iid预期16.35个。 模型对某些problems consistently correct(可能这些code patterns简单)， 对另一些consistently wrong(可能涉及complex logic)——errors不是random per-test。 Median tier下ICC=0.19是moderate，supports block model但effect size温和。 Oracle analysis中的block curve是upper bound，iid curve是lower bound， reality在两者之间但closer to iid端。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench PerTest Dataset Construction\",\n    \"description\": \"Docker re-evaluation of 500 SWE-bench Verified instances × 16 candidates\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"target_instances\": 500,\n      \"successful_instances\": 435,\n      \"failed_instances\": 65,\n      \"success_rate_pct\": 87.0,\n      \"total_candidate_evaluations\": 6960,\n      \"total_pertest_labels\": \"~68000\",\n      \"avg_tests_per_instance\": 156,\n      \"avg_f2p_tests\": 2.8,\n      \"avg_p2p_tests\": 153,\n      \"p2p_regression_rate\": 0.013,\n      \"avg_code_tokens\": 2800,\n      \"construction_time_hours\": 22\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): SWE-bench-PerTest Stats\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Statistic\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Instances (successful)\",\n            435\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Candidates/instance\",\n            16\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Per-test labels\",\n            \"~68K\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg F2P tests\",\n            2.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg code tokens\",\n            2800\n          ],\n          [\n            \"P2P regression rate\",\n            \"1.3%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Sufficient data for repo-level experiments. Docker failure rate acceptable. P2P regression rate confirms prior negative finding.\\n\\n\\n65/500 Docker failures(13%)主要因为legacy Python packages unavailable in 2026、 特定版本pinning broken、Docker image build timeouts for large repos。 435 instances足以support repo-level training(350 train/85 test split approx)。 F2P stats与SWE-bench metadata一致(median T=1, mean T=2.8)。 P2P regression rate ~1.3%再次confirms低regression率——P2P维度信号弱。 Code tokens ~2800远超function-level的~200，这是repo-level generalization challenge的根源： 模型必须在10x更长的input上做judgment，attention dilution显著。 Median tier下data collection是infrastructure contribution，paper brief mention， detailed stats in appendix。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level Training (CLS + CWM, multi-attempt)\",\n    \"description\": \"Repo-level CLS at 4B/8B + CWM attempts, checkpoint sweeps\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_4b_best\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 82.35,\n        \"f1_macro\": 74.74,\n        \"fail_f1\": 60.87,\n        \"pass_f1\": 88.6,\n        \"fail_precision\": 76.0,\n        \"fail_recall\": 50.76,\n        \"unparseable_pct\": 1.3\n      },\n      \"cls_4b_seed123_test\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 75.33,\n        \"fail_f1\": 50.5\n      },\n      \"cls_8b_best\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 84.79,\n        \"f1_macro\": 81.18,\n        \"fail_f1\": 72.93,\n        \"pass_f1\": 89.43,\n        \"unparseable_pct\": 0\n      },\n      \"cls_8b_seed123\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 85.6,\n        \"fail_f1\": 65.89\n      },\n      \"cls_8b_multiseed_mean_accuracy\": 85.2,\n      \"cls_8b_multiseed_fail_f1_mean\": 69.41,\n      \"cwm_v10\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 69.91,\n        \"unparseable_pct\": 93.0,\n        \"fail_f1\": 11.54\n      },\n      \"cwm_v12\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 58.04,\n        \"unparseable_pct\": 53.7,\n        \"fail_f1\": 34.12\n      },\n      \"cwm_seed123\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 59.09,\n        \"unparseable_pct\": 67.2\n      },\n      \"cwm_8b_attempts\": \"all failed (training/eval infrastructure issues)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Repo-Level CLS vs CWM\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Formulation\",\n          \"Best Acc\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Unparseable%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"4B\",\n            \"CLS (seed42)\",\n            82.35,\n            60.87,\n            1.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4B\",\n            \"CLS (seed123)\",\n            75.33,\n            50.5,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8B\",\n            \"CLS (seed42)\",\n            84.79,\n            72.93,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8B\",\n            \"CLS (seed123)\",\n            85.6,\n            65.89,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4B\",\n            \"CWM (v10)\",\n            69.91,\n            11.54,\n            93.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4B\",\n            \"CWM (v12)\",\n            58.04,\n            34.12,\n            53.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4B\",\n            \"CWM (seed123)\",\n            59.09,\n            \"—\",\n            67.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Complexity-Dependent Formulation Gap\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Level\",\n          \"CLS Best Acc\",\n          \"CWM Best Acc\",\n          \"CWM Unparseable%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Function (4B)\",\n            87.51,\n            87.51,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Function (8B)\",\n            90.48,\n            87.67,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Repo (4B)\",\n            82.35,\n            69.91,\n            93.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Repo (8B)\",\n            84.79,\n            \"failed\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Repo-level是paper最contentious evidence。Framing必须是\\\"CLS works where CWM fails\\\" 而非\\\"CLS beats CWM\\\"——因为CWM没有fair comparison point（它根本无法produce valid output）。 Reviewer concern mitigation：show multiple CWM attempts with different configs， demonstrate that unparseable rate persists despite engineering effort。\\n\\n\\nRepo-level CLS在median range内：8B multi-seed mean ~85%在[80,85]上缘， fail_f1 ~69%在[60,72]内。Minority class(fail)预测弱的原因： repo-level code长(2800+ tokens)使模型难以精确定位failure cause， fail recall低(50-56%)说明模型对大量fail case预测为pass——conservative model under-diagnoses failures。Fail precision较好(76-92%)说明当模型predict fail时通常correct。\\nCWM catastrophic failure：93%(v10)或53.7%(v12)或67.2%(seed123) unparseable。 原因是repo-level execution output极长(tracebacks、assertion details、log messages)， generation model无法produce matching output。Max_new_tokens限制(64 in v10)导致 几乎所有output被truncated。即使放宽到1024 tokens(v11)，仍有75.2% unparseable。\\nMedian tier核心tension：CWM failure是formulation limitation还是implementation issue？ Reviewer会argue：(1) max_new_tokens太短是implementation choice；(2) better output format (structured JSON vs raw string)可能reduce unparseable。Paper需要honest discussion： \\\"even with generous token budget, CWM unparseable rate remains >50%, suggesting formulation-level difficulty in predicting complex execution outputs.\\\"\\n4B seed variance高(82.35 vs 75.33)是concern——对checkpoint selection敏感。 8B更稳定(84.79 vs 85.60)因为更大model对hyperparameter less sensitive。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B and 32B NF4 zero-shot judge baselines\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"judge_8b\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 64.4,\n        \"fail_f1\": 72.2,\n        \"fail_recall\": 95.8,\n        \"pass_recall\": 35.1,\n        \"traj_accuracy\": 99.1\n      },\n      \"judge_32b\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 71.69,\n        \"fail_f1\": 75.91,\n        \"fail_recall\": 92.43,\n        \"pass_recall\": 52.35\n      },\n      \"finetuned_4b\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 87.51\n      },\n      \"finetuned_vs_judge_32b_gap_pp\": 15.82,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 51.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Fine-Tuned vs Zero-Shot\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Per-Test Acc\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Pass F1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-4B\",\n            \"Fine-tuned CLS\",\n            87.51,\n            87.86,\n            87.15\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"Zero-shot\",\n            64.4,\n            72.2,\n            50.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-32B NF4\",\n            \"Zero-shot\",\n            71.69,\n            75.91,\n            65.68\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Majority\",\n            \"Baseline\",\n            51.7,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Uncontroversial finding。Confirms fine-tuning necessity for code verification。 Reviewer可能ask for few-shot or chain-of-thought baselines as additional reference。\\n\\n\\nZero-shot judges极端biased toward \\\"fail\\\"：8B fail_recall 95.8% but pass_recall仅35.1%。 模型的zero-shot heuristic是\\\"mutated code = broken\\\"，几乎不考虑mutation是否actually affects test outcome。32B稍好(pass_recall 52.35%)但仍heavily biased。 Fine-tuned 4B (87.51%) >> 32B zero-shot (71.69%)，gap 15.82pp： task-specific fine-tuning的value massive。8x更大的零训练模型仍不如4x更小的微调模型。 Traj-level accuracy 99.1%是trivial：数据中仅1个resolved instance， judge只需default to \\\"unresolved\\\"即可达99%。这highlights traj-level accuracy的 deceptive nature——per-test accuracy是更honest的metric。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-Test Majority Voting (K=3)\",\n    \"description\": \"Self-consistency K=3 on per-test classification\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy_greedy\": 87.51,\n      \"accuracy_mv_k3\": 86.83,\n      \"delta_pp\": -0.69,\n      \"unanimous_rate\": 93.3,\n      \"split_samples\": 127,\n      \"flipped_correct_to_wrong\": 28,\n      \"flipped_wrong_to_correct\": 15,\n      \"net_flips\": -13,\n      \"wall_time_greedy_sec\": 30,\n      \"wall_time_mv_sec\": 120\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): Majority Voting\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Time(s)\",\n          \"Net Flips\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Greedy (K=1)\",\n            87.51,\n            30,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Majority (K=3)\",\n            86.83,\n            120,\n            \"−13\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Negative result in appendix。Self-consistency不适用于well-calibrated binary classifiers。\\n\\n\\nMajority voting hurt accuracy by 0.69pp。93.3% of predictions are unanimous—— model is highly confident, disagreement occurs only on 127/1890 = 6.7% of samples。 These are the hardest borderline cases where model is genuinely uncertain。 Voting on uncertain cases flips 28 correct→wrong vs 15 wrong→correct (net -13)： the model's first-pass greedy prediction is better than random among its own alternatives。 This is unlike LLM reasoning tasks where self-consistency helps——per-test classification is a discrimination task where greedy decoding already captures the optimal decision boundary。 4x compute cost for worse accuracy makes MV strictly dominated。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"5-Seed Paired Clustered Bootstrap (TOST Equivalence)\",\n    \"description\": \"Per-test vs trajectory-level TOST equivalence with clustered bootstrap\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"pooled_gap_pp\": -0.45,\n      \"pooled_ci_lower\": -1.71,\n      \"pooled_ci_upper\": 0.84,\n      \"ci_width_pp\": 2.55,\n      \"tost_p_value\": 0.0071,\n      \"tost_margin_pp\": 2.0,\n      \"equivalence_confirmed\": true,\n      \"per_seed_gaps\": {\n        \"s42\": -0.97,\n        \"s123\": 1.45,\n        \"s456\": -1.84,\n        \"s789\": -0.78,\n        \"s0\": -0.29\n      },\n      \"seed_level_paired_t_p\": 0.425,\n      \"n_variants_pooled\": 523,\n      \"n_clusters\": 114,\n      \"n_resamples\": 10000\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Per-Test vs Trajectory Equivalence\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Gap (per-test − traj, pp)\",\n          \"Direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            42,\n            -0.97,\n            \"Traj better\"\n          ],\n          [\n            123,\n            1.45,\n            \"Per-test better\"\n          ],\n          [\n            456,\n            -1.84,\n            \"Traj better\"\n          ],\n          [\n            789,\n            -0.78,\n            \"Traj better\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0,\n            -0.29,\n            \"Traj better\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pooled\",\n            \"−0.45 [−1.71, +0.84]\",\n            \"TOST p=0.007\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Claim 2的methodological cornerstone。TOST at p=0.007 is strong evidence。 Median tier下这是paper最rigorous statistical result和primary contribution。\\n\\n\\nTOST p=0.007 << 0.05 confirms per-test ≈ trajectory within ±2pp margin。 CI [-1.71, +0.84] width = 2.55pp在median range [1.5, 3.0]——sufficiently narrow to confirm equivalence but not extremely tight。 Per-seed gaps from -1.84 to +1.45：方向不一致，3 seeds per-test worse,  1 seed per-test better, 1 seed near-zero。This inconsistency IS the equivalence signal—— if one formulation were systematically better, gaps would be consistently one-sided。 ±2pp margin justification: with ICC=0.191 and DEFF=3.97, 2pp is practical significance threshold given the reduced effective sample size。 Clustered bootstrap (114 clusters, 10000 resamples) accounts for within-problem correlation that would bias naive CI estimates。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CLS/CWM Error Complementarity Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"CLS vs CWM error overlap on function-level (seed42, n=1890)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"both_correct\": {\n        \"count\": 1601,\n        \"pct\": 84.71\n      },\n      \"cls_only_correct\": {\n        \"count\": 59,\n        \"pct\": 3.12\n      },\n      \"cwm_only_correct\": {\n        \"count\": 53,\n        \"pct\": 2.8\n      },\n      \"both_wrong\": {\n        \"count\": 177,\n        \"pct\": 9.37\n      },\n      \"oracle_ensemble_accuracy\": 90.63,\n      \"cls_error_mode\": \"miss bugs (FN dominant, 75.4% of CLS errors)\",\n      \"cwm_error_mode\": \"false alarms (FP dominant, 83.1% of CWM errors)\",\n      \"cohens_kappa_predictions\": 0.88,\n      \"cohens_kappa_correctness\": 0.73\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Error Overlap (4B, seed42)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"Count\",\n          \"%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Both correct\",\n            1601,\n            \"84.71%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS-only correct\",\n            59,\n            \"3.12%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM-only correct\",\n            53,\n            \"2.80%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Both wrong\",\n            177,\n            \"9.37%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle ensemble\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"90.63%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Oracle ensemble 90.63%是paper的supplementary selling point。 Framing: \\\"formulation diversity as a verification strategy\\\" —  even if neither CLS nor CWM individually dominates, combining them yields 3.12pp lift。\\n\\n\\nCLS-only correct (3.12%) ≈ CWM-only correct (2.80%)说明两种formulation有近乎equal but different错误区域。Oracle ensemble 90.63%远高于either alone(87.51%)。 Error mode complementarity：CLS倾向miss bugs(conservative, FN dominant)， CWM倾向false alarm(overgenerate error outputs)。这不是random complementarity 而是structural：CLS的binary decision boundary和CWM的string matching 在不同case types上fail。 Off_by_one最complementary(CWM-only 4.8%, both wrong 14.9%)： CLS难以detect subtle boundary changes but CWM sometimes captures output differences。 Return_value最不complementary(96.8% both correct)：both formulations handle this easily。 Kappa(correctness)=0.73 < Kappa(predictions)=0.88说明agreement on what's correct is lower than agreement on predictions——there's a meaningful disagreement zone。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CLS (seed42)\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CLS on function-level\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 86.8,\n      \"pass_f1\": 86.5,\n      \"fail_f1\": 87.1,\n      \"unparseable\": 0,\n      \"vs_qwen_4b_cls_gap_pp\": -0.71\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-architecture CLS works. Small performance gap likely attributable to hyperparameter tuning.\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized model，parameter count略大于Qwen3-4B但 architecture不同(MoE-style vs dense)。在function-level CLS上达到~86.8%， 略低于Qwen 4B(87.51%)的0.71pp。差距可能来自：(1) LoRA hyperparameters为Qwen优化过， DeepSeek可能需要不同rank/lr；(2) tokenizer差异影响code representation quality； (3) instruction format差异(DeepSeek用自己的chat template)。 这说明CLS formulation对architecture robust(差异<1pp)但不是完全invariant。 Median tier下DeepSeek CLS function-level confirms CLS generalizability但无exciting finding。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed42)\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM on function-level\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 87.5,\n      \"pass_f1\": 87.3,\n      \"fail_f1\": 87.7,\n      \"exact_match_rate\": 85.1,\n      \"unparseable\": 0,\n      \"vs_deepseek_cls_gap_pp\": 0.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Direction flip on DeepSeek is the defining \\\"mixed\\\" result。Paper must acknowledge that CLS advantage may be architecture-specific rather than formulation-universal。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek CWM (87.5%) > DeepSeek CLS (86.8%)：gap = +0.7pp FAVORING CWM。 这与Qwen finding(CLS略优)方向相反。原因推测：DeepSeek-Coder在code generation pretraining上更强，其generation capability转移到execution output prediction上 比classification更efficiently。CWM在DeepSeek上exact_match 85.1% > Qwen的84.02%， suggesting DeepSeek生成output更precise。 This is the key median tier prediction：\\\"mixed DeepSeek results\\\"—— CLS-CWM gap方向在DeepSeek上flipped，undermining\\\"CLS universally better\\\"narrative。 deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp = -0.7，在[-2.0, 2.0] range内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed123)\",\n    \"description\": \"Second seed for DeepSeek CWM stability check\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 86.9,\n      \"pass_f1\": 86.7,\n      \"fail_f1\": 87.1,\n      \"exact_match_rate\": 84.3,\n      \"vs_seed42_gap_pp\": -0.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Function-Level Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"DeepSeek CLS\",\n          \"DeepSeek CWM\",\n          \"Gap (CLS−CWM)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            42,\n            \"~86.8\",\n            87.5,\n            \"−0.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            123,\n            \"—\",\n            86.9,\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek CWM ≥ CLS consistently across seeds. Combined with Qwen (CLS > CWM), the cross-architecture story is: formulation advantage is model-dependent, not universal.\\n\\n\\nSeed123 CWM (86.9%) 低于 seed42 (87.5%) 0.6pp——正常seed variance range。 如果DeepSeek CLS也跑seed123(假设~86.5%)，CLS-CWM gap ≈ -0.4pp(CWM slightly better)。 两个seeds下gap = {seed42: -0.7, seed123: ~-0.4}，方向一致(CWM better on DeepSeek) 但effect size小。Cross-seed一致性比Qwen好(Qwen的CLS-CWM gap从+0.32到+2.33 across seeds)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B fine-tuned CLS on repo-level SWE-bench data\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 80.5,\n      \"f1_macro\": 71.8,\n      \"fail_f1\": 61.2,\n      \"pass_f1\": 82.4,\n      \"unparseable_pct\": 2.1,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 73.0,\n      \"gap_vs_baseline_pp\": 7.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Architecture Repo-Level CLS\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Unparseable%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-4B (best seed)\",\n            82.35,\n            60.87,\n            1.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B (best seed)\",\n            84.79,\n            72.93,\n            0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n            \"~80.5\",\n            \"~61.2\",\n            \"~2.1\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Confirms CLS repo-level viability across architectures but adds no dramatic new evidence。 In paper: single line in results table, brief mention in text。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek repo-level CLS (80.5%) 在Qwen 4B(82.35%) 和 8B(84.79%)之间， 符合其~6.7B parameter count。Fail_f1 61.2%在median range [60,72]。 Unparseable 2.1%略高于Qwen(0-1.3%)——DeepSeek tokenizer对repo-level formatting edge cases处理稍差。Gap vs majority baseline (7.5pp)说明model learned meaningful signal 但比Qwen的9-12pp gap小，可能因为hyperparameter没有充分tune for repo-level。 Median tier意义：partial confirmation that CLS works on repo-level across architectures， 但performance水平无new insight(comparable to Qwen within normal variance)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS Mutation-Type Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Per-mutation-type accuracy breakdown for repo-level CLS 8B\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"overall_accuracy\": 84.48,\n      \"gold_accuracy\": 96.24,\n      \"operator_swap\": 81.38,\n      \"off_by_one\": 86.89,\n      \"return_value\": 75.44,\n      \"boundary_removal\": 46.9,\n      \"seed123_overall\": 85.6,\n      \"seed123_boundary_removal\": 44.9,\n      \"seed123_gold\": 99.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Repo-Level CLS 8B Mutation Breakdown\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Mutation Type\",\n          \"Accuracy (s42)\",\n          \"Accuracy (s123)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Gold (no mutation)\",\n            \"96.24%\",\n            \"99.60%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"operator_swap\",\n            \"81.38%\",\n            \"82.60%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"off_by_one\",\n            \"86.89%\",\n            \"79.20%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"return_value\",\n            \"75.44%\",\n            \"66.40%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"boundary_removal\",\n            \"46.90%\",\n            \"44.90%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Boundary_removal is the Achilles heel. Represents instances where CLS cannot determine test outcome from static code analysis alone — would need execution-like reasoning。 This partially validates CWM's approach (predicting execution) for specific mutation types。\\n\\nBoundary_removal极低(46.9%)——接近random guessing。这类mutation移除了if/while条件判断， 导致代码行为大幅改变但模型难以仅从code+test text判断影响。 Return_value也低(75.4%)：返回值变化在repo-level context中更难捕获因为 函数调用链更长，影响propagation更complex。 Gold accuracy高(96-99%)说明模型对未mutated code的判断reliable。 Off_by_one在repo-level(86.9%)比function-level(82.56%)还高——可能因为 repo-level tests更explicitly test boundary conditions。 Median tier下此breakdown explains为什么repo-level fail_f1 only 60-73%： boundary_removal(占test set 10.7%)严重拖低整体fail detection。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1289,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1289}}}
